              "format": "bold",
              "text": "Context written for this site: "
            },
            {
              "text": "During consideration of financing six police vehicles, Kyle Maurer explained how the proposed master lease would operate."
            },
            {
              "text": "\n\n"
            },
            {
              "format": "bold",
              "text": "Relevant discussion from the official meeting minutes: "
            },
            {
              "text": "\n\nWhen asked by Council Member Shelton what a master lease was, Mr. Maurer explained it was a leasing agreement that would set the terms for the out-clauses. It was structured like an auto loan.\n\n"
            },
            {
              "format": "link",
              "text": "View minutes, page 6",
